            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Oklo & other nuclear stocks climb, Public Storage upgraded",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> tracks Monday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Nuclear stocks, including Oklo (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OKLO\">OKLO</a>), NuScale Power (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SMR\">SMR</a>), and Nano Nuclear Energy (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NNE\">NNE</a>), are rising.</p>\n<p>Beyond Meat (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BYND\">BYND</a>) stock continues to nosedive after the company's bond investors accepted a debt swap to dilute shares.</p>\n<p>Public Storage (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PSA\">PSA</a>) was upgraded to Buy from Hold by Deutsche Bank.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
